sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Commuter Mobile App
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant I as Identity Provider
    participant T as Ticketing & Payments Service
    participant F as Fraud Detection Service
    participant P as Payment Gateway (external)
    participant D as Ticketing/Payments Store

    M->>I: Authenticate
    I-->>M: Short-lived access token
    M->>G: POST /validate-ticket [TLS]
    G->>I: Validate token
    I-->>G: Valid
    G->>T: Forward request
    T->>F: scoreEvent(commuterId, vehicleId, timestamp)
    F-->>T: Risk score
    T->>P: Authorise payment [TLS]
    P-->>T: Approved
    T->>D: Write ticket and payment
    T-->>G: 200 OK
    G-->>M: 200 OK
